[
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.159999847412109,
    "text": "So, we decided we had to put in a new well, and somebody asked me why I didn't get it"
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 6.159999847412109,
    "end": 7.159999847412109,
    "text": "which."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 7.159999847412109,
    "end": 9.640000343322754,
    "text": "And I didn't know what he was talking about, so they said, there's an old fella out here"
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 9.640000343322754,
    "end": 13.760000228881836,
    "text": "that which his wells, and he'll get you water every time."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 13.760000228881836,
    "end": 17.040000915527344,
    "text": "So I said, okay, how much does he want?"
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 17.040000915527344,
    "end": 18.040000915527344,
    "text": "He wants ten bucks."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 18.040000915527344,
    "end": 19.31999969482422,
    "text": "I said, bring him on."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 19.31999969482422,
    "end": 24.68000030517578,
    "text": "So we brought this fella out, and he went through his maneuvers with his peach stick,"
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 24.68000030517578,
    "end": 27.959999084472656,
    "text": "or I don't remember now if it was a peach stick or a well."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 27.959999084472656,
    "end": 28.959999084472656,
    "text": "You used both though."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 28.959999084472656,
    "end": 29.959999084472656,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 29.959999084472656,
    "end": 30.959999084472656,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 30.959999084472656,
    "end": 31.959999084472656,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 31.959999084472656,
    "end": 32.959999084472656,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_000.mp3",
    "start": 32.959999084472656,
    "end": 32.959999084472656,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_001.mp3",
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 50.0,
    "text": "One works as good as the other, and he strikes a point where he hits water, and he puts a stone down, and he goes down in that same line, and where he hits water again, he puts another stone down."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_001.mp3",
    "start": 50.0,
    "end": 57.0,
    "text": "Then he goes at right angles with this, and he gets a stone over here, and a stone over here, and where these two lines cross, that's the point."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_001.mp3",
    "start": 57.0,
    "end": 59.0,
    "text": "That would kind of be the..."
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_001.mp3",
    "start": 59.0,
    "end": 61.0,
    "text": "The things!"
  },
  {
    "chunk": "chunk_002.mp3",
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 66.69999980926514,
    "text": "He said these water veins always run on an angle, never due north and south, or east and west, or north, west, south, east."
  }
]